  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Telecommunication Union: Core Contribution (2023-24)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DITRDCA makes an annual (core) payment to ITU for membership and technical assistance programs. The funds contribute to the ITU&apos;s global program, which includes the allocation of global radio spectrum and satellite orbits, development of interoperable telecommunications standards, and connecting unserved and underserved communities worldwide.</narrative>
